Jan 08, 2020 04:55;615b4bc478e5e400705e432d;Jazz requested for logs for the past 3 days from PCCWG and updated that on 27th December 2019 unavoidable emergency maintenance activity was performed on the link due to heavy excavation work by authorities in operational path (Karak – Kohat). The link was re-routed to the alternate/best available path to avoid any outage.

And requested logs is required to identify the improvement after re-routing to alternate path for proactive approach before going to start the testing as per shared plan, Which help/leads us to revise testing plan if necessary after analyzing the logs.

Feedback provided to Jazz as follows 

{color:#1f497d}"Intermittent errors have been observed from your network especially yesterday 06.01.2020, today we observed the circuit down with AIS alarm from your end from 01:09 GMT to 02:27 GMT."{color}

{color:#1f497d} {color}

{color:#1f497d}Awaiting Jazz feedback on what caused the outage today (07.01.2020). {color}

